        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE         ASTON CLINTON              LONDON ROAD                                             north side 5/17                                        No.110 _ -                                           II House. c.1820 with later porch. Red brick, hipped slate roof with projecting eaves and small ornamental modillions. Flanking chimneys. 2-storeys, 3 bays of sashes, flanking ones 4 panes wide, central 3 panes. Flat finely gauged and splayed brick arches. Door in later C19 enclosed porch with moulded brick cornice on pilasters with diamond triglyphs, moulded architrave and flat arch, 6 panel door (2 upper glazed) with rectangular fanlight. Side doors to porch filled with windows. Listing NGR: SP8858011894"
    }
  ],
